Once those were finished, producers and execs took their time with making a decision, ultimately landing on Pattinson for the role. With the process of finding Bond now behind them, producers will now look to fill out the remaining cast members which include a new Bond Lady, the villain as well as the roles of M and Q.

After premiering last month on CBS , " NCIS: New York " has now sold across more than 135 markets worldwide.

The LL Cool J -fronted spin-off, which sees the actor return as Senior Special Agent Sam Hanna, has sold to a range of broadcasters including free-to-air, pay TV and global streamers across six continents. It is produced by CBS Studios and licensed by Skydance Global Content Sales. Related Stories 'Cher Adores Michael Douglas,' Icon's Rep Says After Douglas Disses Her Oscar Win for 'Moonstruck' Governors Awards 2026: Glenn Close, Ridley Scott and More Receive Honorary Oscars From The Academy (Live Updates)

The show, which comes three years after "NCIS: Los Angeles" wrapped on 14 seasons, was created by "The Pitt" creator R. Scott Gemmill, who exec produces alongside LL Cool J, Byron Balasco, Adam Davidson, Kyle Harimoto and Jason Barrett. Balasco showruns the series. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-article-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid-articleX","mid","mid-article"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[300,250],[2,2],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[320,480],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

"NCIS: New York" sees Hannah return to his hometown for a one-off case before finding himself drawn back in and ready to work with a new team comprised of Jennifer Beals (playing Assistant Special Agent-in-Charge Robyn Wells), Scott Caan (Senior Field Agent Nick Schaeffer), Jacqueline Byers (Special Agent Addison "Addy" Ross), Shane Harper (Special Agent Wyatt Sellers) and Devin Druid (Sean Sullivan).

"It's exciting to introduce the next iteration of the NCIS universe to the entire world," said LL Cool J. "I can't wait for people to see what we do with these stories and how we take the world on a guided tour of parts of New York they've never seen before."

Among those who've acquired the series are M-Net for Africa, Disney for the Balkans, Global and StackTV for Canada, Hot and Yes for Israel, J:Com and Wowow for Japan, AXN for Latin America, Sky for New Zealand, Amazon for Southeast Asia and Paramount+ for Australia, Austria, Brazil, Ireland, Latin America, Germany, Switzerland and the U.K. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

Variety &#8216;s reviewer Aramide Tinubu called the show &#8220;a well-oiled machine&#8221; and said LL Cool J and Caan &#8220;have great chemistry and work well as a buddy-comedy duo.&#8221;

&#8220;With a beloved character in Sam and some brand-new faces entering the scene, the show is steady, intriguing and will likely go the distance,&#8221; she concluded.

Netflix has released a trailer for Ava DuVernay 's compelling and urgent documentary 14 th , ahead of its November 27 theatrical release and December 4 debut on the streaming platform. Watch it above.

The Oscar-contending film argues the 14 th Amendment of the Constitution, passed in the wake of the Civil War, laid the groundwork for America's multiracial democracy. It explores how the MAGA movement has made it a priority to dismantle the rights enumerated in that amendment.

"We are all at peril," law professor Sherrilyn Ifill comments in the trailer. "If we don't think it's coming for us, we are so sadly mistaken." Former Georgia State Representative Stacey Abrams notes, "The whole of the 14 th is under assault. If the 14 th falls, then every other right that it guarantees is now in jeopardy." blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article1-uid0' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article1","mid","mid-articleX","mid-article","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article") .addSize([[2,2],[300,250],[620,350],[300,251],[501,282],[3,3],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

One of the amendment's five provisions mandates birthright citizenship &#x2013; meaning anyone born in the United States is considered a citizen. The Trump administration has attempted to circumvent that as part of its broader attack on immigration. In the trailer, Vice President JD Vance says, "The concept of birthright citizenship is an absurdity." Watch on Deadline if ( !window.pmc.harmony?.isEventAdScheduledTime() ) { pmcCnx.cmd.push(function() { pmcCnx({ settings: { plugins: { pmcAtlasMG: { iabPlcmt: 2, } } }, playerId: '32fe25c4-79aa-406a-af44-69b41e969e71', playlistId: '0199e506-e642-7728-8264-463efe71337b', }).render("connatix_contextual_player_div"); }); } else { // This should only be get called when page cache is not cleared and it's event time. window.pmc.harmony?.switchToHarmonyPlayer(); }

In June, the U.S. Supreme Court struck down the president's executive order that declared children born in the U.S. to parents in the country unlawfully were not entitled to birthright citizenship. But the decision was by no means unanimous. Conservative Justices Clarence Thomas, Samuel Alito, and Neil Gorsuch dissented.

14 th premiered at the New York Film Festival in October and screened this weekend at IDFA in Amsterdam, the world's biggest documentary festival. We spoke with DuVernay briefly before her IDFA Q&A Sunday night and she told us she hopes people will take seriously threats to the 14 th Amendment and not be lulled into complacency by the results of the midterm elections, which delivered a decisive repudiation of the president and his policies.

14 th is produced by DuVernay, Spencer Averick, Paul Garnes, and Tammy Thomas-Garnes. Samantha Casey serves as archival producer. Spencer Averick edited the film; the cinematography is by Cliff Charles and Michael Fernandez. The score is composed by Jason Moran. The film is a production of Array Filmworks. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dl-mid-article-inject2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid-article2","mid-articleX","mid-article","mid","300x251"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[300,250],[300,251],[620,350],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366]]) .exemptFromSleep() .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

DuVernay earned an Academy Award nomination for her previous documentary, 13 th . In October, she won the Documentary Filmmaker Award at the Montclair Film Festival in New Jersey and 14 th won the Audience Award for Documentary Feature at the Middleburg Film Festival in Virginia.

